{
  "source_sha256": "49809656b765f4ac858ce68187d911335dd416a2b809bfdfdbf3a3a26ef7303d",
  "entries": [
    {
      "concept_id": "health:one:step:1",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 25,
      "original": "(1)天芮星为病神，旺于月建，落离宫，正应头部；逢死门，上乘白虎，凶。乙+壬，死+庚均凶。",
      "source_sha": "5312e822a249d61fb22beb81e56042f4c21ef37c2db0ec9366b842861a10fcbf",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19960923.nasal_cancer",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": false,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:one:step:2",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 27,
      "original": "(2)天心星和乙奇为医生，分别落兑宫和离宫，均不能克天芮落宫，故病无治。",
      "source_sha": "8bd8db5304fd55bbff31d628cac75ff6918583c9bdf71b841db2154ebff38b37",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19960923.nasal_cancer",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": false,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:one:step:3",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 29,
      "original": "(3)日干癸为病人，落坎宫，虽临天任吉星、生门吉门、值符吉神，但逢空亡，年命不保。又癸+辛为网盖天牢，测病必死。",
      "source_sha": "37e454bb0dfb8402180646cb377cd06162868412731250155b159852e44d8134",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19960923.nasal_cancer",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": false,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:one:step:4",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 31,
      "original": "(4)阴遁天芮星落离宫为内盘，主近主快。值符天任星克坎水，克逢克为应期，戌土克坎水近，当死于戊戌月。地盘甲午辛与坎宫子午相冲，冲者以合为应期，午未后，丁火生未土合力大，故当死于戊戌月丁未日。",
      "source_sha": "7bd61f25f76160a6a1048bed8312c3226122875a5fa88713e65bd06258b97fb0",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19960923.nasal_cancer",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": false,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:two_a:step:1",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 85,
      "original": "(1)病星天芮所临之干不同，阴遁、阳遁、内外不同：A卦病星天芮临庚，且阳遁坤2宫为外盘，主体表，主肌肤，庚在外主筋骨；时干也代表病，A卦时干为癸，癸在外盘，主体表，主神经系统；另外，断病还可看伤门，A卦伤门临辛，辛也主筋骨，故断脑中枢神经系统疾患。B卦病星天芮临癸，且阴遁坤2宫主内，主脾胃，癸为水道；时干庚也为病，在内主大肠，也主结节、肿块；伤门临壬，壬也主水道，据此，故B卦断为食道癌或胃癌。",
      "source_sha": "c0ec0f318792a740ab74bfe2562991d6501267d7059428aa0ca0b40e7fdaf365",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "retrospective_comparison",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19950219.brother_paralysis",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": true,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:two_a:step:2",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 87,
      "original": "(2)年龄大小不同，年命落宫不同：A卦其弟1995年才二十三岁，年命癸落坤2宫虽为入墓之地，但逢空亡，又在外盘，主远主慢；二十三岁少男，还可看艮宫，艮宫临乙奇，乙奇为医生和药物，又临生门，故断他近期内还不致于有生命危险，不过瘫痪在床罢了。B卦其父1996年已经七十五岁，年命辛落4宫为入墓之地，甲午辛加甲午辛为自刑；年命辛虽在外盘，但病神在内盘，主近主快；又老父可看乾宫，乾宫内己加己为地户逢鬼凶格，测病发凶或必死，故断其父必死无疑。",
      "source_sha": "94acd3cdcbdb4db20d92209f912cbaf497815d60db3e413d0e67905c5cd511a0",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "retrospective_comparison",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19950219.brother_paralysis",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": true,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:two_a:step:3",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 89,
      "original": "(3)月令不同，病星落宫旺相休囚不同：A卦月令为寅月，病星坤宫处死地，病神被制，故不至于死；B卦月令为未月，病星坤宫当令最旺，故发凶必死。",
      "source_sha": "e8110fd62252f520744c626980017f4555f956feb8fe0df23ac17d80edd74c0b",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "retrospective_comparison",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19950219.brother_paralysis",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
