      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:three_a:step:3",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 115,
      "original": "(3)天心星和乙奇为医生和药物，分别落兑宫、离宫，均不克病星落宫，病无治。",
      "source_sha": "f203990db978b2195faf3a084d992e7c1820782799b0229a6e23f6c7e4ec61ef",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19980616.hen_illness",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": false,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:three_a:step:4",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 117,
      "original": "(4)综上所述分析，病无治，必死。因日干辛处死墓之地，又死于月令午火，根据死墓绝应期，金怕火克，必死于火日火时，今正逢甲午日，故判死于当日巳时或午时。",
      "source_sha": "b82e705208b7091dfea62781732c8531dca4b5b9edfc477e3e8d382354d112f1",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
