    {
      "concept_id": "health:three_b:step:1",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 139,
      "original": "(1)天芮星为病神，落坤宫。生门+死门，病难救。",
      "source_sha": "2aa702da53d929a3a6250dd9d90f8225d1b552256921e8bfbb24fb0228a14754",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19980621.rooster_illness",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": false,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:three_b:step:2",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 141,
      "original": "(2)天心星和乙奇为医生和药物，分别落乾宫和坤宫，均不克天芮星落宫，病无治。",
      "source_sha": "01eb22b9ab9d3558f7f916307444ba97878547fcb0cacf2593328dfa8e45374e",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19980621.rooster_illness",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": false,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:three_b:step:3",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 143,
      "original": "(3)日干己为病鸡，落巽宫为旺地，又得月令午火之生，旺极。物极必反，故必死。",
      "source_sha": "a58b8a6fdaba97e648ccff1bf371a07cf4a315e5c2f0a0010e09507fdc5d1d2f",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19980621.rooster_illness",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": false,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:three_b:step:4",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 145,
      "original": "(4)综上述，病无治，必死。因开门落巽宫为门迫，又反吟，故死速。日干己土旺极，必死于长生之地，火土同源，应死于寅日寅时，又时比日速，故判死于次日(庚子日)寅时，即1998年6月22日寅时，此为长生旺相应期。",
      "source_sha": "a46577b9810dae080102b143d9019cbc36acdaaa67b210b209fdf6c7c7cdcc49",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19980621.rooster_illness",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": false,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:four:step:1",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 187,
      "original": "(1)首先看天芮星落宫，今天芮星在坤2宫伏吟，与死门同宫，但甲申旬中午未空，天芮星与死门同宫时，常主肿瘤等疾病，今见空亡，说明脑内无肿瘤。又乙奇为医药，落巽4宫，克天芮星所落之坤2宫，假使有肿瘤，也会医好的。日干乙奇在巽宫，克天芮星落宫，无妨。",
      "source_sha": "4dfe2dd7559ab607d679959ebef78a7e4da933fb64a7fc5b9a59c28c96e0394b",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19991020.wang_craniotomy",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": false,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:four:step:2",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 189,
      "original": "(2)次看离9宫，离宫在人体也代表头部，离宫天英星、景门伏吟，格局为辛+辛自刑，临白虎主头脑胀痛，英星、景门均属火，火为气态，无实体质量，故也可断头部无肿瘤。",
      "source_sha": "78ec804502d08418f65d54e82ecad15be8435809da21cf7068c065085bfcb3d4",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19991020.wang_craniotomy",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": false,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:four:step:3",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 191,
      "original": "(3)再看乾宫情况：乾宫天心星开门伏吟，格局丁+丁星奇入太阴吉格，上乘螣蛇，螣蛇主虚幻不实，也是没有肿瘤之象。",
      "source_sha": "dacc3d06054b8c107df95390c9156d1aa9a6e72bb153ff00cd58e2ad63d3ffb1",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19991020.wang_craniotomy",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": false,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:four:step:4",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 193,
      "original": "(4)最后看值符落宫：值符与天蓬星、休门同宫，格局为庚+庚战格。战格为凶格，庚为阻隔不通之象，蓬星、休门代表水、血液。值符宫直克代表头部的离9宫。水克火，离宫主眼目，故视力下降的根本原因在于头部有积水或积血，压迫视神经而导致视力下降。",
      "source_sha": "60b9b465531f28a799ad8a18531542c0a863824f0f34a8f31f321802b42442fd",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19991020.wang_craniotomy",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": false,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:four:step:5",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 195,
      "original": "(5)再看一下年命落宫情况：王连明是戊子年生人，年命戊落震三宫，临天冲星、伤门，格局戊+戊伏吟：凡事闭塞阻滞，静守为吉。再者戊落震宫，又形成六仪击刑之凶格，震宫主人肝脏，故病之根源在于上火，肝火上炎于头部，肝开窍于目，火攻目，导致头部视神经附近有积血压迫，视力下降，因戊所在之震3宫克天芮星落宫，故病可愈。",
      "source_sha": "87aad9df08dbd112f3ed2899d5153d06c8424bc15d599fe5ae1108e59633a3ec",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19991020.wang_craniotomy",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": false,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:four:step:6",
      "kind": "health_author_step",
      "line": 197,
      "original": "(6)开门代表手术，今开门在乾6宫伏吟不动，有不用手术之象，又开门宫不克天芮星落宫，所以手术是无用的。",
      "source_sha": "9f46fa263b7ead5c3274f02d337f7ae60dca819167ea0f36e6a9bf13937b3c6c",
      "meta": {
        "topic": "prior_to_book_feedback",
        "source_case_id": "kaiwu.health.19991020.wang_craniotomy",
        "source_scope": "traditional health text",
        "medical_facts_not_independently_verified": true,
        "after_feedback_cannot_be_initial_prediction": false,
        "positive_training_eligible": false
      },
      "relation": "additional_exposition",
      "track": "kaiwu:health:v1:health_author_step"
    },
    {
      "concept_id": "health:critical_symbol_combo",
      "kind": "health_editor_topic",
      "line": 39,
      "original": "(1)癌症的标志：天芮病星与死门、六仪庚、凶神白虎聚在一起，多数情况下为癌症或其他绝症。天芮为九星中的病星，死门为八门中最凶之门，庚为六仪中最凶一干，白虎为八神中最凶之神。这四个最凶的符号聚到一起，自然表示病症最凶最危，是不治之症了。但不一定都是癌症。另外，其中三个符号聚在一起有时也是癌症。大家可以在实践中进一步验证。",
      "source_sha": "b9938b92c2bae207b36161c547144f21393ea7d6dfd8b1ffbb282a9698585511",
      "meta": {
